{"nodes": [{"id": "claude_snap_bottom_sheet_library", "label": "snap-bottom-sheet (library overview)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "What this is", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Published React bottom-sheet library on a private npm registry (https://npm-repo.rajman.org). lib/ is the shipped code; src/ is only a Vite playground for manual testing. There is deliberately no test suite \u2014 verification is running `pnpm dev` and dragging the sheet."}, {"id": "claude_compound_component_pattern", "label": "Compound component pattern (Sheet + .Container + .DynamicHeight)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Public API is assembled in lib/index.ts via Object.assign so consumers compose markup themselves instead of passing render props; chosen for flexibility of content layout."}, {"id": "claude_responsibility_split", "label": "Responsibility split: state gate vs engine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture / Responsibility split", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sheet.tsx holds only `present` (keeping the sheet mounted through the closing animation) and builds context \u2014 no DOM, no animation. SheetContainer.tsx owns ref, spring, gestures, portal decision, so nearly all behavior changes land in one file or a hook it calls."}, {"id": "claude_pixel_y_offset_model", "label": "Pixel y-offset-from-top internal model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All internals work in y-offset from the top (0 = fully open, viewHeight = closed) rather than heights, so the spring animates a single scalar. getSnapValues converts: <= 1 is a fraction of view height, > 1 absolute pixels, then viewHeight - offset. Sorted descending with 0 forced last so index 0 is always the lowest snap regardless of consumer order."}, {"id": "claude_snap_point_model", "label": "Snap point model (number | dynamic | SnapPointConfigObj)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A snap point is a number, the SnapPointDynamicValue string, or a config object { value, scroll?, drag? } \u2014 one union so per-snap scroll and drag locks travel with the value instead of living in parallel prop arrays."}, {"id": "claude_content_mode", "label": "Content mode (no real snap points)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With no real snap points the sheet hugs its content: container renders height: fit-content and drag-up is pinned to the content height."}, {"id": "claude_dynamic_height_first_child_constraint", "label": "Sheet.DynamicHeight must be the first child", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture / SheetWithDynamicHeight.tsx", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SheetWithDynamicHeight is a marker component (returns children unchanged, carries displayName = DynamicHeightComponentId). findDynamicHeightComponent only inspects the FIRST child of Sheet.Container, so the marker silently does nothing anywhere else. Likewise SnapPointDynamicValue must be the first snap entry; validateDynamicSnapPosition only console.warns."}, {"id": "claude_animation_single_spring", "label": "Single spring on y, all motion via useAnim.animate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One useSpring on y; every position change goes through animate(y, cb?, { jump }) so transforms are never set directly. y.set() is reserved for hard clamps in the drag-end handler."}, {"id": "claude_stable_gesture_binding", "label": "Stable gesture binding via useEffectEvent", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drag handlers are wrapped in useEffectEvent so the @use-gesture/react binding stays referentially stable while the handlers still read fresh state."}, {"id": "claude_drag_close_threshold", "label": "Close-by-drag threshold at index 0", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "onDragEndEventHandler picks the target snap with getClosestIndex, and closes the sheet when dragged past DragOffsetThreshold (80px) while at index 0. It emits onSnap(-1, null) before onClose() so consumers see the sheet leave the snap model before it unmounts."}, {"id": "claude_scroll_locking", "label": "Per-snap scroll locking", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Scroll locking", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "useScrollLock returns a ref of activate/deactivate toggling overflowY/touchAction on the sheet element and locks documentElement/body overflow for the sheet's lifetime. Scroll is enabled only for snaps declared { scroll: true }; useSnapScroll re-applies the lock and scrolls content to top when the active snap changes from outside. onDragEventHandler only takes over dragging on a scrollable snap once content is already at scrollTop 0, so native scroll and drag never fight."}, {"id": "claude_shared_observer_singletons", "label": "Shared ResizeObserver / resize-listener singletons", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Height tracking", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "useWatchHeight(ref?, cb?) returns offsetHeight, or window.innerHeight with no ref. Both the ResizeObserver and the window resize listener are module-level singletons \u2014 one observer for the whole app rather than one per sheet."}, {"id": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "label": "Four portal / wrapper render modes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sheet.Container renders as SSR plain markup (isSSR), portal to document.body with position: fixed and no overlay, portal into wrapperPortalElement with wrapper div + overlay, or an in-place wrapper div + overlay with position: absolute. Overlay only exists when overlayColor is set AND wrapper is truthy \u2014 useMount warns otherwise. Overlay background is written imperatively through document.querySelector('#snap-bottom-sheet-wrapper-overlay') instead of React state to avoid re-rendering the sheet on every drag."}, {"id": "claude_nested_sheets", "label": "Nested sheets and overlay drag isolation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "onDragStart calls event.stopPropagation() and cancels the gesture when it originates on an overlay, so an inner sheet's drag does not move the outer one."}, {"id": "claude_import_alias_sync", "label": "@lib / @ import aliases declared in four configs", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Import alias", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Library code self-imports via @lib/*, playground via @/*. Aliases must stay in sync across vite.config.ts, vite.config.lib.ts, tsconfig.app.json and tsconfig.lib.declarations.json; .ts/.tsx extensions appear in specifiers because allowImportingTsExtensions is on."}, {"id": "claude_peer_deps_external", "label": "Peer deps kept external in the build", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Commands", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "react, react-dom, @react-spring/web and @use-gesture/react are externals so the published bundle never duplicates the consumer's copies (double React / double spring registry)."}, {"id": "claude_library_conventions", "label": "Library conventions (default exports, types, constants, SSR effect)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Conventions", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default exports, one hook per useX.ts file, all shared types in lib/types.ts, magic values in lib/constants.ts, useIsomorphicLayoutEffect from @react-spring/web instead of useLayoutEffect for SSR safety, and every public export added to lib/index.ts because vite-plugin-dts rolls dist types up from it."}, {"id": "claude_graphify_workflow", "label": "graphify query-first workflow for this repo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "graphify", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Codebase questions should start with `graphify query`, `path`, or `explain` because they return a scoped subgraph far smaller than GRAPH_REPORT.md or raw grep; GRAPH_REPORT.md is reserved for broad architecture review, and `graphify update .` refreshes the graph AST-only with no API cost."}], "edges": [{"source": "claude_compound_component_pattern", "target": "lib_index_sheet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_responsibility_split", "target": "lib_components_sheet_sheet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture / Responsibility split", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_responsibility_split", "target": "lib_components_sheetcontainer_sheetcontainer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture / Responsibility split", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_dynamic_height_first_child_constraint", "target": "lib_components_sheetwithdynamicheight_sheetwithdynamicheight", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_dynamic_height_first_child_constraint", "target": "lib_utils_finddynamicheightcomponent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_dynamic_height_first_child_constraint", "target": "lib_components_sheetdynamicheightcontent_sheetdynamicheightcontent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_dynamic_height_first_child_constraint", "target": "lib_constants_dynamicheightcomponentid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Architecture", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_dynamic_height_first_child_constraint", "target": "lib_utils_validatedynamicsnapposition", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_pixel_y_offset_model", "target": "lib_utils_getsnapvalues", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_snap_point_model", "target": "lib_constants_snappointdynamicvalue", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_snap_point_model", "target": "claude_pixel_y_offset_model", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_content_mode", "target": "lib_utils_iscontentmode", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_content_mode", "target": "lib_components_sheetcontainer_sheetcontainer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Snap point model", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_animation_single_spring", "target": "lib_hooks_useanim_useanim", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_animation_single_spring", "target": "lib_events_ondragendeventhandler_ondragendeventhandler", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_stable_gesture_binding", "target": "lib_hooks_useeffectevent_useeffectevent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_stable_gesture_binding", "target": "lib_components_sheetcontainer_sheetcontainer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_drag_close_threshold", "target": "lib_events_ondragendeventhandler_ondragendeventhandler", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_drag_close_threshold", "target": "lib_utils_getclosestindex", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_drag_close_threshold", "target": "lib_constants_dragoffsetthreshold", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_scroll_locking", "target": "lib_hooks_usescrolllock_usescrolllock", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Scroll locking", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_scroll_locking", "target": "lib_hooks_usesnapscroll_usesnapscroll", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Scroll locking", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_scroll_locking", "target": "lib_events_ondrageventhandler_ondrageventhandler", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Animation and gestures / Scroll locking", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_scroll_locking", "target": "claude_snap_point_model", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Scroll locking", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_shared_observer_singletons", "target": "lib_hooks_usewatchheight_usewatchheight", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Height tracking", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "target": "lib_utils_isssr", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "target": "lib_components_sheetcontainer_sheetcontainer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "target": "lib_hooks_usemount_usemount", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "target": "lib_constants_overlayelementid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "target": "lib_components_sheetoverlay_sheetoverlay", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "target": "lib_hooks_usewrapperref_usewrapperref", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_nested_sheets", "target": "lib_events_ondragstarteventhandler_ondragstarteventhandler", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_nested_sheets", "target": "claude_portal_wrapper_modes", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Portal / wrapper modes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_snap_bottom_sheet_library", "target": "lib_hooks_usesnapstate_usesnapstate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "useSnapState", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "lib_hooks_usesnapstate_usesnapstate", "target": "claude_dynamic_height_first_child_constraint", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "useSnapState", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_library_conventions", "target": "lib_index_sheet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Conventions", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_snap_bottom_sheet_library", "target": "claude_graphify_workflow", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "graphify", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "drag_gesture_flow", "label": "Drag gesture flow (start, live drag, end/snap-or-close)", "nodes": ["lib_components_sheetcontainer_sheetcontainer", "lib_events_ondragstarteventhandler_ondragstarteventhandler", "lib_events_ondrageventhandler_ondrageventhandler", "lib_events_ondragendeventhandler_ondragendeventhandler", "lib_utils_getclosestindex", "lib_constants_dragoffsetthreshold", "lib_hooks_useanim_useanim"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md"}, {"id": "dynamic_height_pipeline", "label": "Dynamic height detection and measurement pipeline", "nodes": ["lib_components_sheetwithdynamicheight_sheetwithdynamicheight", "lib_utils_finddynamicheightcomponent", "lib_components_sheetdynamicheightcontent_sheetdynamicheightcontent", "lib_hooks_usewatchheight_usewatchheight", "lib_constants_dynamicheightcomponentid", "lib_utils_validatedynamicsnapposition"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md"}, {"id": "render_mode_decision", "label": "Portal / wrapper / SSR render-mode decision", "nodes": ["lib_components_sheetcontainer_sheetcontainer", "lib_utils_isssr", "lib_components_sheetoverlay_sheetoverlay", "lib_constants_overlayelementid", "lib_hooks_usemount_usemount", "lib_hooks_usewrapperref_usewrapperref"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md"}]}